  "_comment": "The multi editor (FTR-APP-011): one tab, the multi's program number then the part shown in three groups, the assistant's proposal of 2026-11-01, data the owner can change. Parameter names are those of mcp::ParameterCatalogue::multis(), and the two values with no catalogue row, part program and multi program number (DEC-APP-042, DEC-APP-043). [RQ-APP-100, RQ-APP-102, RQ-APP-103, ADR-APP-006 (DEC-APP-041 to DEC-APP-043), ADR-APP-004 (DEC-APP-024, DEC-APP-029)]",
